      "review_summary": "Adds `openclaw devices rename`, `device.pair.rename`, protocol/Swift schema entries, and an `operatorLabel` field used by CLI device-list display.\n\nPR surface: Source +138, Other +18. Total +156 across 11 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level. The PR head writes `operatorLabel`, while paired-device rebuild code omits that field and the Control UI/docs/logging paths still do not match the new contract.",
